": "Like if you give if you ask it to build some application, it's going to build that application for you which you can customize further.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-15-freely-automate-90-of-your-coding-tasks-with-these-ai-ides-m-3f91baa7aa:u000005"}], "text": "By giving a prompt to an editor like replit.com, users can generate code to build an application, such as a solar system UI."}, "title": "Prompt-Based Code Generation", "topic": "AI coding editors"}, "content_hash": "122bc5965ff1a1965899d6231f1d6fb4c2ecef72e5489b5119edbce58de64229", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2025-02-15-freely-automate-90-of-your-coding-tasks-with-these-ai-ides-m-3f91baa7aa:knowledge:08f684ed6954c091", "metadata_hash": "8235ad0c60ccb01182b37fb101af1c2ac2712ed1f5d2f1e3c629cafcd09b25e3", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2025-02-15", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "31d0d02fbadc8e5cbec8bb4c2d47b112090dc512759d488f4f88360a4cd12d9e", "source_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-15-freely-automate-90-of-your-coding-tasks-with-these-ai-ides-m-3f91baa7aa", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mQV32qQsTz4", "title": "Prompt-Based Code Generation", "topic": "AI coding editors", "topic_slug": "ai-coding-editors"}
